#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&katomic; is a fun and educational game built around molecular geometry. It "
"employs a simplistic two-dimensional look at the elements which comprise a "
"molecule. A molecule is disassembled into its separate atoms and scattered "
"around the playing field. The player must reassemble the molecule in order "
"to complete the current level and move up to the next one."
msgstr ""
"&katomic; je zabavna i edukativna igra izgrađena oko molekularne geometrije. "
"Koristi jednostavan dvo-dimenzionalni pogled na elemente koji čine molekulu. "
"Molekula je rastavljena u njene sastavne atome i raspršena po igraćem polju. "
"Igrač mora ponovo sastaviti molekulu da bi završio trenutni nivo i prešao na "
"sljedeći."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reassemble molecules from compound atoms by sliding them around."
msgstr "Ponovo sastavi molekule od atoma koji čine spoj pomičući ih okolo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&katomic; will load level one once you start the game and you can begin "
"playing right away. To see how the molecule you are supposed to make looks "
"like, take a look at the upper right corner. To play, click on an atom. You "
"will see green arrows pointing in the directions where atom can move. To "
"move the atom, click on the desired arrow. When an atom starts moving, it "
"will not stop until it hits another atom or a wall, so make sure you think "
"before you do your next move. You can assemble your molecule wherever you "
"like on the game board, but some places are easier to access than others. "
"When the molecule is assembled, you can move to the next level."
msgstr ""
"&katomic; će učitati prvi nivo kada pokrenete igru i odmah možete početi "
"igrati. Da bi vidjeli kako izgleda molekula koju trebate sastaviti, "
"pogledajte u gornji desni ugao. Da bi igrali, kliknite na atom. Vidjet ćete "
"zelene strelice koje pokazuju na smjerove kojim se atom može kretati. Za "
"pomjeranje atoma, kliknite na željenu strelicu. Kada se atom počne kretati, "
"neće se zaustaviti sve dok ne udari u drugi atom ili u zid, pa dobro "
"razmislite prije nego što se odlučite na sljedeći potez. Možete sastaviti "
"svoju molekulu gdje god želite na igraćoj ploči, ali neka mjesta su lakša za "
"pristup od drugih. Kada je molekula sastavljena, možete preći na idući nivo."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, Strategije i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "Pravila Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game pieces can only move in one direction at a time."
msgstr "U jednom trenutku se atomi mogu kretati samo u jednom pravcu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once an atom begins moving it will not stop until it meets either a wall or "
"another piece."
msgstr ""
"Kada se atom počne kretati, neće se zaustaviti sve dok ne udari u zid ili u "
"drugi atom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The only way to progress to the next game level is to complete a current "
"one. Once a player completes a certain level the game automatically switches "
"to the next one, thus 'uncovering it'."
msgstr ""
"Jedini način za prelazak u drugi nivo igre jeste da se završi trenutni nivo. "
"Kada igrač završi određeni nivo igre, on automatski \"otkriva\" novi nivo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "A player can only switch between the levels which have been uncovered."
msgstr "Igrač može da bira samo otkrivene nivoe igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game progress is automatically saved every time an adjacent level is "
"reached, and will be reloaded the next time application is started."
msgstr ""
"Napredak u igri je automatski sačuvan svaki put kada je naredni nivo "
"dosegnut, i bit će ponovo učitan idući puta kada se aplikacija pokrene."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Always review the complete molecule using the reference screen before making "
"any moves."
msgstr ""
"Uvijek prije poteza pregledajte cijelu molekulu koristeći referentni ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next, study the play field and plan your moves. Remember, once a piece is "
"moved it may not be possible to return it into the starting position."
msgstr ""
"Zatim, proučite igraće polje i isplanirajte svoje poteze. Zapamtite, jednom "
"kada pomjerite atom, možda nećete biti u mogućnosti da ga vratite na početnu "
"poziciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Think through your every move and try to visualize the trajectory piece will "
"follow once a directional arrow is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Razmišljajte o svakom svom potezu i potrudite se da zamislite putanju kojom "
"će se atom kretati kada kliknete na strelicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When using the keyboard to move pieces make sure that the desired piece is "
"selected. If a wrong atom is marked as selected, use the &Tab; key to switch "
"between the pieces until you reach a desired one."
msgstr ""
"Kada koristite tastaturu za pomjeranje atoma, uvjerite se da ste odabrali "
"željeni atom. Ako je pogrešan atom markiran kao odabrani, koristite se &Tab; "
"tipkom da odaberete neki drugi sve dok ne dođete do željenog."

