#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I know what the molecule looks like?"
msgstr "Kako da znam kako molekula izgleda?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can view the molecule on the reference screen located in the top right "
"corner of the game screen."
msgstr ""
"Možete vidjeti molekulu na referentnom ekranu koji se nalazi u gornjem "
"desnom uglu igraćeg prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I move a game piece (atom)?"
msgstr "Kako da pomjerim atom?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move a game piece (atom) use your mouse cursor to click on it. At this "
"time the available directional icon will become visible. Click on the "
"corresponding directional icon to make a game piece move into the desired "
"direction. Alternatively, you can use your keyboard to move the pieces. Use "
"the &Tab; key to switch between the items, and the cursor keys to move them "
"once selected."
msgstr ""
"Za pomjeranje atoma koristite se mišem da biste kliknuli na njega. Nakon što "
"to učinite, prikazat će Vam se strelice u raznim smjerovima. Kliknite na "
"odgovarajuću strelicu za pomjeranje atoma u željenom smjeru. Možete se "
"koristiti i tastaturom za pomjeranje atoma. Koristenjem &Tab; tipku "
"mijenjate odabrani atom, a kursor tipkama odabrani atom pomjerate u željenom "
"pravcu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to control the pieces (atoms)?"
msgstr "Mogu li se koristiti tastaturom za pomjeranje atoma?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. Use &Tab; key to switch between the items, and he cursor keys to move "
"them once selected."
msgstr ""
"Da. Koristite &Tab; tipku mijenjate odabrani atom, a kursor tipkama odabrani "
"atom pomjerate u željenom pravcu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When I move a piece (atom) it goes right past the place where I want it. How "
"do I make it stop there?"
msgstr ""
"Kada pomjerim atom, on prođe pored mjesta na kojem želim da se zaustavi. "
"Kako ga zaustaviti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You don't. Once an atom begins moving, it will not stop until it meets "
"either a wall or another piece."
msgstr ""
"Ne možete. Jednom kad se atom pokrene, neće se zaustaviti sve dok ne udari u "
"zid ili u drugi atom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot beat the level. Is there a hint system, or a solver?"
msgstr "Ne mogu preći nivo. Ima li savjet za rješenje, ili rješavač?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No. Unfortunately at this time &katomic; does not feature a hint system. So "
"the only way to finish a level is to solve it on your own."
msgstr ""
"Ne. Nažalost trenutno &katomic; nema funkciju savjeta za rješenje nivoa. "
"Jedini način da završite nivo je da ga sami riješite."

